msgstr "Thiet bi luu tru USB (Co ban)"

#. • MSG_046
msgid "%s (Disk %d) [%s]"
msgstr "%s (Dia %d) [%s]"

#. • MSG_047
#.
#. Used when a drive is detected that contains more than one partition
msgid "Multiple Partitions"
msgstr "Da phan vung"

#. • MSG_048
msgid "Rufus - Flushing buffers"
msgstr "Rufus - Dang xa bo dem"

#. • MSG_049
msgid "Rufus - Cancellation"
msgstr "Rufus - Huy bo"

#. • MSG_050
msgid "Success."
msgstr "Thanh cong."

#. • MSG_051
msgid "Undetermined error while formatting."
msgstr "Loi khong xac dinh khi dang dinh dang."

#. • MSG_052
msgid "Cannot use the selected file system for this media."
msgstr "Khong the dung he thong tap tin da chon cho thiet bi nay."

#. • MSG_053
msgid "Access to the device is denied."
msgstr "Truy cap toi thiet bi da bi tu choi."

#. • MSG_054
msgid "Media is write protected."
msgstr "Thiet bi dang duoc bao ve ghi."

#. • MSG_055
msgid "The device is in use by another process. Please close any other process that may be accessing the device."
msgstr "Thiet bi dang duoc dung boi tien trinh khac. Vui long dong moi tien trinh co the dang truy cap thiet bi."

#. • MSG_056
msgid "Quick format is not available for this device."
msgstr "Dinh dang nhanh khong kha dung voi thiet bi nay."

#. • MSG_057
msgid "The volume label is invalid."
msgstr "Nhan o dia khong hop le."

#. • MSG_058
msgid "The device handle is invalid."
msgstr "Tham chieu thiet bi khong hop le."

#. • MSG_059
msgid "The selected cluster size is not valid for this device."
msgstr "Kich thuoc cum da chon khong hop le voi thiet bi nay."

#. • MSG_060
msgid "The volume size is invalid."
msgstr "Kich co thiet bi khong hop le."

#. • MSG_061
msgid "Please insert a removable media in drive."
msgstr "Vui long cam thiet bi luu tru di dong vao o."

#. • MSG_062
msgid "An unsupported command was received."
msgstr "Da nhan mot lenh khong duoc ho tro."

#. • MSG_063
msgid "Memory allocation error."
msgstr "Loi sap xep bo nho."

#. • MSG_064
msgid "Read error."
msgstr "Loi doc."

#. • MSG_065
msgid "Write error."
msgstr "Loi ghi."

#. • MSG_066
msgid "Installation failure"
msgstr "Cai dat that bai"

#. • MSG_067
msgid "Could not open media. It may be in use by another process. Please re-plug the media and try again."
msgstr "Khong the mo thiet bi. Co the no dang duoc tien trinh khac su dung. Vui long cam lai thiet bi va thu lai."

#. • MSG_068
msgid "Could not partition drive."
msgstr "Khong the phan vung thiet bi."

#. • MSG_069
msgid "Could not copy files to target drive."
msgstr "Khong the sao chep tep vao thiet bi dich."

#. • MSG_070
msgid "Cancelled by user."
msgstr "Da huy boi nguoi dung."

#. • MSG_071
#.
#. See http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thread_%28computing%29
msgid "Unable to start thread."
msgstr "Khong the bat dau luong."

#. • MSG_072
msgid "Bad blocks check didn't complete."
msgstr "Kiem tra khoi hong chua hoan tat."

#. • MSG_073
msgid "ISO image scan failure."
msgstr "Quet tep ISO that bai."

#. • MSG_074
msgid "ISO image extraction failure."
msgstr "Trich xuat tep ISO that bai."

#. • MSG_075
msgid "Unable to remount volume."
msgstr "Khong the tai gan o dia."

#. • MSG_076
msgid "Unable to patch/setup files for boot."
msgstr "Khong the va/cai dat tap tin cho viec khoi dong."

#. • MSG_077
msgid "Unable to assign a drive letter."
msgstr "Khong the gan ky tu o dia."

#. • MSG_078
msgid "Can't mount GUID volume."
msgstr "Khong the gan ket phan vung GUID."

#. • MSG_079
msgid "The device is not ready."
msgstr "Thiet bi chua san sang."

#. • MSG_080
msgid ""
"Rufus detected that Windows is still flushing its internal buffers onto the USB device.\n"
"\n"
"Depending on the speed of your USB device, this operation may take a long time to complete, especially for large files.\n"
"\n"
"We recommend that you let Windows finish, to avoid corruption. But if you grow tired of waiting, you can just unplug the device..."
msgstr ""
"Rufus da phat hien Windows van dang xa bo dem ben trong thiet bi USB.\n"
"\n"
"Tuy thuoc vao toc do thiet bi USB cua ban, hoat dong nay co the mat mot thoi gian dai de hoan tat, dac biet voi nhung tap tin lon.\n"
"\n"
"Chung toi khuyen rang ban nen de Windows ket thuc de phong hong du lieu. Nhung neu ban cam thay qua lau, hay cu thao thiet bi ra..."

#. • MSG_081
msgid "Unsupported image"
msgstr "Tep tin khong duoc ho tro"

#. • MSG_082
msgid "This image is either non-bootable, or it uses a boot or compression method that is not supported by Rufus..."
msgstr "Tep nay khong co kha nang khoi dong hoac su dung mot tuy chon khoi dong hoac nen khong duoc Rufus ho tro..."

#. • MSG_083
msgid "Replace %s?"
msgstr "Thay the %s?"

#. • MSG_084
msgid ""
"This ISO image seems to use an obsolete version of '%s'.\n"
"Boot menus may not display properly because of this.\n"
"\n"
"A newer version can be downloaded by Rufus to fix this issue:\n"
"- Choose 'Yes' to connect to the internet and download the file\n"
"- Choose 'No' to leave the existing ISO file unmodified\n"
"If you don't know what to do, you should select 'Yes'.\n"
"\n"
"Note: The new file will be downloaded in the current directory and once a '%s' exists there, it will be reused automatically."
msgstr ""
"Tep ISO nay co ve la phien ban loi thoi cua '%s'.\n"
"Cac menu khoi dong co the khong hien chinh xac vi dieu nay.\n"
"\n"
"Mot phien ban moi co the duoc tai xuong boi Rufus de khac phuc van de nay:\n"
"- Chon 'Co' de ket noi voi Internet va tai tap tin xuong\n"
"- Chon 'Khong' de khong thay doi tap tin ISO dang co\n"
"Neu ban khong biet phai lam gi, ban nen chon 'Co'.\n"
"\n"
"Ghi chu: Tap tin moi se duoc tai xuong vao thu muc hien tai va mot khi '%s' ton tai trong do, no se duoc tu dong tai su dung."

#. • MSG_085
msgid "Downloading %s"
msgstr "Dang tai xuong %s"

#. • MSG_086
msgid "No image selected"
msgstr "Chua tep tin nao duoc chon"

#. • MSG_087
#.
#. This message appears in Advanced format options → Check device for bad blocks → dropdown menu
#. %s will be replaced with SLC, MLC or TLC, which is a type of NAND (or flash memory). In other
#. words, this message should mean "for a flash memory device of type %s". *Please* try to keep
#. the translation as short as possible so that it won't result in an overly large dropdown...
#. If you prefer, it's okay to use "type" or "device" instead of "NAND" (e.g. "for TLC type").
#. See also MSG_035.
msgid "for %s NAND"
msgstr "cho %s NAND"

#. • MSG_088
msgid "Image is too big"
msgstr "Tep tin qua lon"

#. • MSG_089
msgid "The image is too big for the selected target."
msgstr "Tep tin qua lon cho thiet bi dich da chon."

#. • MSG_090
msgid "Unsupported ISO"
msgstr "ISO khong duoc ho tro"

#. • MSG_091
msgid "When using UEFI Target Type, only EFI bootable ISO images are supported. Please select an EFI bootable ISO or set the Target Type to BIOS."
msgstr "Khi su dung kieu he thong khoi dong UEFI, chi ho tro cac tep ISO co kha nang khoi dong bang EFI. Vui long chon mot tep ISO co ho tro EFI hoac chuyen kieu he thong khoi dong sang BIOS."

#. • MSG_092
msgid "Unsupported filesystem"
msgstr "He thong tap tin khong duoc ho tro"

#. • MSG_093
msgid ""
"IMPORTANT: THIS DRIVE CONTAINS MULTIPLE PARTITIONS!!\n"
"\n"
"This may include partitions/volumes that aren't listed or even visible from Windows. Should you wish to proceed, you are responsible for any data loss on these partitions."
msgstr ""
"QUAN TRONG: O DIA NAY CHUA NHIEU PHAN VUNG!!\n"
"\n"
"Co the bao gom phan vung/o dia khong co trong danh sach hoac khong hien thi trong Windows. Neu ban tien hanh, ban se phai chiu trach nhiem ve moi ton that du lieu tren nhung phan vung nay."

#. • MSG_094
msgid "Multiple partitions detected"
msgstr "Da phat hien nhieu phan vung"

#. • MSG_095
msgid "DD Image"
msgstr "Tep tin DD"

#. • MSG_096
msgid "The file system currently selected can not be used with this type of ISO. Please select a different file system or use a different ISO."
msgstr "Khong the dung loai ISO nay voi he thong tap tin da chon. Vui long chon mot he thong tap tin hoac chon tep ISO khac."

#. • MSG_097
msgid "'%s' can only be applied if the file system is NTFS."
msgstr "Chi co the ap dung '%s' neu he thong tap tin la NTFS."

#. • MSG_098
msgid ""
"IMPORTANT: You are trying to install 'Windows To Go', but your target drive doesn't have the 'FIXED' attribute. Because of this Windows will most likely freeze during boot, as Microsoft hasn't designed it to work with drives that instead have the 'REMOVABLE' attribute.\n"
"\n"
"Do you still want to proceed?\n"
"\n"
"Note: The 'FIXED/REMOVABLE' attribute is a hardware property that can only be changed using custom tools from the drive manufacturer. However those tools are ALMOST NEVER provided to the public..."
msgstr ""
"QUAN TRONG: Ban dang co cai dat Windows To Go, nhung o dia dich cua ban khong co thuoc tinh 'CO DINH' (FIXED). Do do, Windows co the bi treo khi khoi dong, vi Microsoft khong thiet ke Windows To Go de hoat dong voi o dia co thuoc tinh 'THAO ROI' (REMOVABLE).\n"
"\n"
"Ban co chac chan muon tiep tuc khong?\n"
"\n"
"Luu y: Thuoc tinh 'CO DINH/THAO ROI' la mot dac diem phan cung va chi co the thay doi bang cong cu dac biet tu nha san xuat o dia. Tuy nhien, nhung cong cu nay HAU NHU KHONG bao gio duoc cung cap cho nguoi dung pho thong..."

#. • MSG_099
msgid "Filesystem limitation"
msgstr "Gioi han tap tin he thong"

#. • MSG_100
msgid "This ISO image contains a file larger than 4 GB, which is more than the maximum size allowed for a FAT or FAT32 file system."
msgstr "Tep ISO nay co chua mot tap tin lon hon 4 GB, lon hon kich thuoc tap tin toi da duoc he thong FAT hoac FAT32 cho phep."

#. • MSG_101
msgid "Missing WIM support"
msgstr "Thieu ho tro WIM"

#. • MSG_102
msgid ""
"Your platform cannot extract files from WIM archives. WIM extraction is required to create EFI bootable Windows 7 and Windows Vista USB drives. You can fix that by installing a recent version of 7-Zip.\n"
"Do you want to visit the 7-zip download page?"
msgstr ""
"Nen tang cua ban khong the giai nen tep tu luu tru WIM. Viec giai nen WIM la can thiet de tao dia USB khoi dong Windows 7 va Windows Vista co ho tro EFI. Ban co the khac phuc dieu nay bang cach cai phien ban moi nhat cua 7-Zip.\n"
"Ban muon truy cap trang tai xuong cua 7-Zip?"

#. • MSG_103
msgid "Download %s?"
msgstr "Tai xuong %s?"

#. • MSG_104
#.
#. Example: "Grub4DOS v0.4 or later requires a 'grldr' file to be installed. Because this
#. file is more than 100 KB in size, and always present on Grub4DOS ISO images (...)"
msgid ""
"%s or later requires a '%s' file to be installed.\n"
"Because this file is more than 100 KB in size, and always present on %s ISO images, it is not embedded in Rufus.\n"
"\n"
"Rufus can download the missing file for you:\n"
"- Select 'Yes' to connect to the internet and download the file\n"
"- Select 'No' if you want to manually copy this file on the drive later\n"
"\n"
"Note: The file will be downloaded in the current directory and once a '%s' exists there, it will be reused automatically."
msgstr ""
"%s hoac moi hon yeu cau tap tin '%s' duoc cai dat.\n"
"Vi tap tin nay lon hon 100 KB, va luon co trong cac tep ISO %s, no khong duoc kem theo trong Rufus.\n"
"\n"
"Rufus co the tai xuong tap tin con thieu cho ban:\n"
"- Chon 'Co' de ket noi voi Internet va tai tap tin\n"
"- Chon 'Khong' neu ban muon tu chep tap tin nay tren dia luc khac\n"
"\n"
"Ghi chu: tap tin se duoc tai xuong thu muc hien tai va khi '%s' ton tai o do, no se tu dong duoc tai su dung."

#. • MSG_105
msgid ""
"Cancelling may leave the device in an UNUSABLE state.\n"
"If you are sure you want to cancel, click YES. Otherwise, click NO."
msgstr ""
"Huy bo co the lam thiet bi roi vao trang thai KHONG THE SU DUNG.\n"
"Neu ban chac chan muon huy, chon CO. Neu khong, hay chon KHONG."

#. • MSG_106
msgid "Please select folder"
msgstr "Vui long chon thu muc"

#. • MSG_107
msgid "All files"
msgstr "Tat ca tap tin"

#. • MSG_108
msgid "Rufus log"
msgstr "Nhat ky Rufus"

#. • MSG_109
msgid "0x%02X (Disk %d)"
msgstr "0x%02X (Dia %d)"

#. • MSG_110
#.
#. "Cluster size" should be the same as the label for IDS_CLUSTER_SIZE_TXT
#. "kilobytes" should be the same as in MSG_027
msgid ""
"MS-DOS cannot boot from a drive using a 64 kilobytes Cluster size.\n"
"Please change the Cluster size or use FreeDOS."
msgstr ""
"MS-DOS khong the khoi dong tu o dia co kich thuoc cum la 64 kilobyte.\n"
"Vui long thay doi kich thuoc cum hoac su dung FreeDOS thay the."

#. • MSG_111
msgid "Incompatible Cluster size"
msgstr "Kich thuoc cum khong tuong thich"

#. • MSG_112
#.
#. "%d:%02d" is a duration (mins:secs)
